# Lightning.Pub (backend)

This repo is the **Lightning.Pub server**: a Nostr-native account/RPC layer on LND. The product UI lives in **ShockWallet** (`shocknet/wallet2`). Work here is **backend**, except for the **setup wizard** (appliance first-run on Start9/Umbrel). Do not add product UI here.

## Critical files

| Layer | Path | Edit when |
|---|---|---|
| RPC contract | `proto/service/methods.proto`, `structs.proto` | Adding/changing wallet-facing RPCs or types. Regen with `npm run build_autogenerated`. **Never edit** `proto/autogenerated/`. |
| Process edge | `src/index.ts`, `src/auth.ts`, `src/nostrMiddleware.ts` | Boot, HTTP auth, Nostr RPC routing |
| Method table | `src/services/serverMethods/index.ts` | Thin validate-then-dispatch. No business logic. |
| Composition | `src/services/main/init.ts`, `src/services/main/index.ts` (`Main`) | Wiring. Construct new long-lived managers on `Main` (or in `init.ts` if they must exist first). |
| Domain | `src/services/main/*Manager.ts` | Use-cases. Prefer a **new manager** over growing `paymentManager.ts`. |
| CLINK | `src/services/CLINK/` | Offers, debit, enroll, management, beacons (kind-based Nostr, not the generic RPC table) |
| Persistence | `src/services/storage/*Storage.ts`, `entity/`, `migrations/` | CRUD via Storage facades. DB is a subprocess — thread `tx` through money work. |
| Lightning | `src/services/lnd/` (`lnd.ts`, `swaps/`) | LND gRPC, invoices, channels, Boltz swaps |
| Wizard UI | `static/` (`wizard.js`, `wizard.css`, HTML pages) | **Only UI allowed in this repo.** Appliance setup screens. |
| Wizard backend | `src/services/wizard/`, `proto/wizard/` | Wizard RPC + server. Regen with `npm run gen:wizard`. **Never edit** `proto/wizard_service/`. |
| Infra | `src/services/nostr/`, `backup/`, `helpers/` | Relays, encrypted backups, utilities |
| Tests | `src/tests/` | Exercise the same manager APIs production uses |

## Feature path

Proto → storage (entity + migration + `*Storage`) → manager → one `serverMethods` line → test.

Domain code must not care whether HTTP or Nostr called it. Pass `ctx` + `req`; do not inspect Express or Nostr types inside managers.

## Gen Commands

use `npm run gen` and `npm run gen:wizard` to generate the server and wizard transports and types from the proto files